    <mxCell id="legend_bg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="1055" width="2050" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="1061" width="2022" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. Center firewall evaluates top-down: CC-GST denies first, CC-DEF-01 denies and logs the rest.&lt;br/&gt;2. Cloud uses TGW routes, NACLs, security groups and endpoint policies; no NAT, no Network Firewall.&lt;br/&gt;3. Temporary rules to audit: CC-LNK-06 / CL-LNK-05 (qa), CC-ADM-05, CC-ADM-06.&lt;br/&gt;4. Solid = permanent allow; dashed amber = temporary or backup; dashed red = deny or blackhole; dashed grey = reserved." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="1083" width="2022" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
